<title>INDONESIA: Earthquake shakes Indonesia's Irian Jaya.</title>
<headline>Earthquake shakes Indonesia's Irian Jaya.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earth tremor measuring 4.3 on the open-ended Richter scale shook Jayapura, capital of Indonesia's eastern Irian Jaya province, on Saturday, the official Antara news agency reported.</p>
<p>Officials said there were no reports of casualties or damage.</p>
